  "bodyHash": "9bb24d368f864f45",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Edo5jnW.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/適用於 Minecraft-1.19-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"248\" height=\"28\">&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/安裝於-客戶端與伺服器-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spiky-spikes/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spiky-spikes/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📖 關於：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>尖刺尖刺</strong> 添加了許多非常鋒利的尖刺。共有數個階級，每個都有獨特的能力。還在等什麼？快去提升你的生物農場吧！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📚 內容：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">尖刺尖刺為你帶來 <strong>6 種階級</strong> 的尖刺，每一種都獨具特色。</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>木質：</strong>緩慢對生物造成傷害，但無法直接擊殺。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>石質：</strong>會對生物造成傷害並擊殺，但不掉落任何戰利品或經驗值。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鐵質：</strong>會對生物造成傷害並擊殺，僅掉落普通戰利品，不掉落經驗值。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>金質：</strong>會對生物造成傷害並擊殺，僅掉落經驗值，不掉落戰利品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鑽石：</strong>造成大量傷害，生物掉落的所有戰利品如同被玩家擊殺一般。可使用大多數劍類附魔，透過鐵砧進行附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>下界合金：</strong>造成大量傷害，生物掉落的所有戰利品如同被玩家擊殺一般。可使用大多數劍類附魔，透過鐵砧進行附魔。具有爆炸抗性，且不會被凋靈摧毀。對玩家無傷害。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>注意：</strong>為鑽石和下界合金尖刺附魔時，請確保一次準備好所有要附魔的尖刺。你可以將附魔書<strong>一次性套用到整組物品</strong>，因此稍後再為更多尖刺附魔會白白消耗寶貴的附魔書。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 遊戲截圖：</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/957/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/958/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>尖刺確實很尖銳</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>木質尖刺會將生物血量降至半顆心</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/959/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/960/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>即使是凋靈Boss也逃不過下界合金尖刺的攻擊</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>可附魔在尖刺上的所有附魔</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>💡 常見問題：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：如何在 Forge 上設定此模組？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>安裝我的 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模組，即可直接在遊戲內進行設定！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：如何在 Fabric 上設定此模組？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>目前尚未實作直接在遊戲內編輯設定的功能。請在世界中執行 <code>/config showfile &lt;modid&gt;</code> 指令，選擇 <code>CLIENT</code> 或 <code>SERVER</code>（依模組而定），然後點擊聊天視窗中出現的檔案名稱（副檔名為 .toml），即可在外部編輯器中手動編輯設定檔。儲存檔案後，設定檔會在幾秒後自動在遊戲內重新載入，無需重新啟動遊戲。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🏆 鳴謝：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">開發《尖刺尖刺》的過程中獲得以下協助與啟發：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/rwtema\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RWTema</strong></span></a> 啟發了本模組的創作，靈感來自其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-utilities\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Extra Utilities</span></a> 模組舊版本中的尖刺方塊</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/xfacthd\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>XFactHD</strong></span></a> 教導我如何在 Minecraft 中渲染非立方體形狀的「黑暗藝術」</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&message=LunaPixelStudios&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs_&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzss&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=@Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=u/Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=reddit&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs 0212&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-infuser-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ALHMDQn.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Mlxi8cy.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e4TeVgY.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tiny-skeletons-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GCYM7Zl.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q3CooZb.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vz0tBff.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
